msgctxt "#30088"
msgid "Extra padding for sports (minutes)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30089"
msgid "Added on top of the normal end-of-recording padding, only for a new one-time recording created directly from an EPG entry Dispatcharr tags as sports, and only if you haven't already adjusted its end time yourself. 0 disables this. Doesn't affect recurring/series rules. Whether a channel's sports get detected depends on that channel's own EPG source having genre data -- see docs/EPG.md for details."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30047"
msgid "Improve catch-up seek reliability (experimental)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30048"
msgid "Experimental: routes catch-up/archive playback through inputstream.ffmpegdirect (must be installed, or catch-up fails outright) instead of Kodi's own seeking. Testing found this consistently slower with no clear precision benefit over the default -- leave off unless you have a specific reason to try it. See docs/CATCHUP.md for details."
msgstr ""

