msgid "Dispatcharr API key"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30034"
msgid "Generated automatically on first connection and used only to play recordings, which Dispatcharr requires authentication for. Leave blank to have one generated for you -- only set this manually if you need to replace it (e.g. it was revoked or regenerated elsewhere), since regenerating one replaces the previous key for the whole account."
msgstr ""
